    "detailed_description": "The kingdom of Haamit has been attacked by Katrius leaving the king wounded. Kairo, the prince of Haamit and only son to the king must step up and save the kingdom. He is sent by his father to seek an old wise cat from the kingdom, who explains to Kairo that to defeat Katrius, he must get stronger and learn new skills that will help him throughout his journey. While in this adventure, Kairo learns about an old, almost forgotten lore about some mysterious ancient magic that once existed in the kingdom of Haamit. Kairo must embark in a very exciting mission where he must make allies, defeat enemies, battle challenging bosses, learn skills, and solve mysteries; all of these while exploring around different stunning, yet dangerous worlds.",
    "about_the_game": "The kingdom of Haamit has been attacked by Katrius leaving the king wounded. Kairo, the prince of Haamit and only son to the king must step up and save the kingdom. He is sent by his father to seek an old wise cat from the kingdom, who explains to Kairo that to defeat Katrius, he must get stronger and learn new skills that will help him throughout his journey. While in this adventure, Kairo learns about an old, almost forgotten lore about some mysterious ancient magic that once existed in the kingdom of Haamit. Kairo must embark in a very exciting mission where he must make allies, defeat enemies, battle challenging bosses, learn skills, and solve mysteries; all of these while exploring around different stunning, yet dangerous worlds.",
    "short_description": "Guide Kairo throughout this exciting and challenging metroidvania adventure. Defeat enemies, solve mysteries, learn skills and restore peace back to the kingdom of Haamit.",
